  <description>Worlds of extremes whose rotational periods perfectly match their orbital periods. On these planets, the sun never sets and never rises. Their night side is extremely cold due to the complete lack of sunlight, but there is usually a habitable sliver of land on their day side.

Difficulty depends heavily on landing spot, and ranges from easy to nigh impossible.
Generating at least 50% of the planet is recommended.</description>
